= SootopolisCity_EventScript_Maxie
lockall
goto_if_eq VAR_SOOTOPOLIS_CITY_STATE 5 SootopolisCity_EventScript_MaxieRayquaza
msgbox	MAXIE: G… GROUDON… Please! Stop what you're doing!I know the extent of your power now!If you keep going, all HOENN, not just SOOTOPOLIS, will be utterly ruined!
closemessage
releaseall
end
= SootopolisCity_EventScript_MaxieRayquaza
msgbox	MAXIE: So the super-ancient POKéMON weren't only GROUDON and KYOGRE…After all our fruitless scheming and frantic efforts, that one POKéMON's simple action puts everything right again as if nothing had happened…Fu… Fuhahaha…
setflag FLAG_MET_MAXIE_SOOTOPOLIS
goto_if_set FLAG_MET_ARCHIE_SOOTOPOLIS SootopolisCity_EventScript_MaxieArchieLeave
releaseall
end
